Z||000002||Old Lar||10-25-2001||12:54 PM||||6000 rpm  30 mph in 1st<BR>6000 rpm  60 mph in 2nd<BR>6000 rpm  90 mph in 3rd<BR>6000 rpm  120 mph in 4th<BR>5000 rpm  140 mph in 5th<P>70 mph is about 2300-2400 rpm in 5th.<P>Bob Steiger Twin Lakes Fiero in Paxton Illinois.<BR>||||reg||1
